	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Bhringraj: The King of Hair Herbs and the Kshir Pak Vidhi Process]]></title>
		<link>https://dev-medinerbz.pantheonsite.io/blog/bhringraj-king-of-hair-herbs-kshir-pak-vidhi/</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
