		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://dev-medinerbz.pantheonsite.io/?p=202</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In Sanskrit, Bhringraj translates to 'the ruler of bees', referencing its ability to attract and revitalize life. In Ayurvedic trichology, it is revered as the undisputed king for strengthening hair follicles from root to tip.</p><h3>The Art of Kshir Pak Vidhi</h3><p>Unlike industrial oils made by simply adding artificial fragrance to mineral oil, authentic Mediherbz hair vitalizers are crafted through Kshir Pak Vidhi. Fresh botanical herbs are simmered gently with milk and pure sesame oil for over 72 hours until all water evaporates and only the herb-infused lipid core remains.</p>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Why modern chemical serums fall short compared to traditional slow-cooked herbal hair oils infused via ancient Ayurvedic milk-decoction methods.]]></excerpt:encoded>
